Package: nasc
Title: Network-Aware Synthetic Control Estimator
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Frederik", "von Waldow", , "f.vonwaldow@uni-bonn.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment =c(ORCID = "0009-0009-4269-2088"))
Description: Implements the Network-Aware Synthetic Control (NASC) estimator for causal inference in panel data where the SUTVA is violated due to network or spatial interference. The package utilizes a modular Bayesian framework to estimate treatment effects and network dependencies while accounting for spillover magnitude and direction. Besides bias correction it features a novel penalized-weight regularization that discounts donor units based on their contamination risk. Supports Stan-based MCMC sampling for robust inference, covariate adjustment, and automated construction of network-aware counterfactuals using row-standardized spatial weight matrices.
